    Bug 1976254 - Look up SRV records when performing Microsoft Autodiscover. r=mkmelin


    Since DNS records are inherently unsafe (because they lack proper encryption and
    authentication), we're treating them the same way we do with redirects from
    plain HTTP requests, i.e. by not sending any authentication to the derived URL
    without the user's consent.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D256597

